Subject: [PATCH 1/9] ### Fix World Bank API timeouts and FX prediction errors
 in ASEAN Macro Dashboard

**Key features implemented:**
- Updated .gitignore to remove system files entries and reorganize file patterns
- Enhanced World Bank API data fetching with 60-second timeout and 3-retry mechanism with exponential backoff
- Fixed FX prediction timestamp conversion error by adding proper pandas Timestamp handling
- Improved error handling for insufficient historical data cases with clearer user feedback
- Added comprehensive exception handling for SARIMA model fitting and forecasting operations
- Updated data loading logic to handle empty dataframes gracefully before processing

The changes address the connection timeout issues by implementing robust retry logic and resolve the timestamp conversion problems that were preventing FX predictions from being generated. The dashboard now provides more informative error messages when data is insufficient for forecasting.
